<!-- Hero Section -->
<section id="hero" class="hero section dark-background">

    <div id="hero-carousel" class="carousel slide carousel-fade" data-bs-ride="carousel" data-bs-interval="5000">

        <div class="carousel-item active">
            <img src="~/UserSide/assets/img/hero-carousel/GroundImage.jpg" alt="">
            <div class="carousel-container">
                <h2>Welcome to BOX Cricket<br></h2>
                <p>Box cricket is a fast-paced, indoor version of the traditional cricket game. The game is typically played within a small enclosed area or "box," often surrounded by nets. Box cricket is popular in corporate offices, schools, and colleges as a quick recreational activity.</p>
                <a asp-controller="Auth" asp-action="SignIn" asp-area="Authentication" class="btn-get-started">Join Us !</a>
            </div>
        </div><!-- End Carousel Item -->

        <div class="carousel-item">
            <img src="~/UserSide/assets/img/hero-carousel/GroundImage.jpg" alt="">
            <div class="carousel-container">
                <h2>Welcome to BOX Cricket</h2>
                <p>Box cricket is popular in corporate offices, schools, and colleges as a quick recreational activity. Unique rules such as scoring runs by hitting walls or specific zones add excitement to box cricket. Teams in box cricket are usually smaller, consisting of 6–8 players per side.</p>
                <a asp-controller="Auth" asp-action="Ragister" asp-area="Authentication" class="btn-get-started">Sign UP</a>

            </div>
        </div><!-- End Carousel Item -->

        <div class="carousel-item">
            <img src="~/UserSide/assets/img/hero-carousel/GroundImage.jpg" alt="">
            <div class="carousel-container">
                <h2>Welcome to BOX Cricket</h2>
                <p>Unlike traditional cricket, bowlers are often limited to delivering underarm balls in box cricket. The compact playing area ensures constant action, keeping players and spectators engaged. The game encourages strategy, teamwork, and adaptability due to its fast and dynamic nature.</p>
                <a asp-controller="Auth" asp-action="SignIn" asp-area="Authentication" class="btn-get-started">Sign In</a>

            </div>
        </div><!-- End Carousel Item -->

        <a class="carousel-control-prev" href="#hero-carousel" role="button" data-bs-slide="prev">
